<title>USA: Nur Advanced Technologies names CEO.</title>
<headline>Nur Advanced Technologies names CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nur Advanced Technologies said Thursday it had named Erez Shachar as its president and chief executive officer, succeeding Ehud Sarig, who resigned from the position to pursue private investment interests.</p>
<p>Shachar joins Nur Technology from Scitex Corp where he served for eight years, most recently as the vice president of sales and marketing of Scitex Europe, Nur Advanced said in a statement.</p>
